{"title":"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the figure <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> and also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65e4f2d5cc59e5ffbed3734130e8c45b643adc91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is parallel to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />. The area of the larger triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f348b5890100fa57eaa4a3c548badc83b75af585.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ACE$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0aed56990dedba5a88a65e21245ccfd5d5e43ae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$128$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />.\nThe area of the trapezoid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/9/7c9d11f822493c6fa024726ef0750b2917998e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BDEA$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d15d808807bfa561e72dc8111649ed0a204ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Determine the area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/e/cee88eb0e94e7831e4d242c8930836c02c7d5128.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABF$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/c/8bc13e1d9d8740bc4f6f48868cdc693e5c1b390c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(1,2)--(4,0)--cycle,black); draw((1/2,1)--(2.5,1)--(2,0),black); MP(&quot;A&quot;,(4,0),SE);MP(&quot;C&quot;,(1,2),N);MP(&quot;E&quot;,(0,0),SW); MP(&quot;D&quot;,(.5,1),W);MP(&quot;B&quot;,(2.5,1),NE);MP(&quot;F&quot;,(2,0),S); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"148\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In general, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> are similar triangles with sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae90d71491f591ab5a16d19ee7629e8226ec9ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb6c5ddfd368673c178f3323ce2994cdbc8fbdab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> , then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/9/7e9b07b1e5dda076be7d5dfb945fc7705ca8f093.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{Area G}{Area H}=\\frac{(s_1)^2}{(s_2)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"125\" height=\"43\" />.\nHere, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/d/06d14692e8907c90b5e8e04b2779d39e0f546682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle{BCD}$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/d/80dd4921174f7ed95b3d446a7544132bb2f9a72a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{50}{128}=\\frac{25}{64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/5/4558dac720390e26adeddd9fade787a9d5f8c731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle{ACE}$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />, so BC is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f4344e4ce1c2a266b885d9b160544e3036de15f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of AC or AB is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/639534d18207fde5d468bcf2bb90aa2d7ad517ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of AC\nthen  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/4/41434d8a7063c134458eccf34864dbebe86e5298.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle{ABF}$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/6/7e6bbf74be709e8d68570655a79da2482905b754.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/5/4558dac720390e26adeddd9fade787a9d5f8c731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle{ACE}$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> so \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5fd99d8fd841db498ae734a1f1ec2fa0fe293d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABF = \\boxed{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II\">2006 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selfl